#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:2
msgid "SSH in the browser demo"
msgstr "浏览器演示中的 SSH"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Silkie WebAssembly demo is under development. This guide records its networking design and "
"the private relay setup. The :doc:`browser-demo` includes connection controls; end-to-end SSH "
"validation is still pending."
msgstr "Silkie 的 WebAssembly 演示仍在开发中。本指南记录其网络设计与私有中继设置。:doc:`browser-demo` 提供连接控件；端到端 SSH 验证仍待完成。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:10
msgid ""
"The browser demo uses CheerpX to run a Linux shell, basic commands, ``silkie-sprint``, ``silkie-"
"scramble``, and an OpenSSH client. Networking will be optional, using the visitor's own Tailscale"
" network. **Silkie will not operate a public SSH relay.** The shell and bundled games must work "
"without connecting to Tailscale."
msgstr ""
"浏览器演示使用 CheerpX 运行 Linux shell、基本命令、``silkie-sprint``、``silkie-scramble`` 和 OpenSSH "
"客户端。网络连接为可选功能，使用访问者自己的 Tailscale 网络。**Silkie 不会运营公共 SSH 中继。** shell 和内置游戏必须在未连接 Tailscale 时也能运行。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:16
msgid ""
"A web page cannot open a raw TCP socket to port 22. CheerpX provides that connectivity through "
"its `Tailscale integration <https://cheerpx.io/docs/guides/Networking>`_. A netcat relay can then"
" forward SSH to a machine reachable from the visitor's network. Netcat alone does not provide a "
"browser transport: the relay recipe below also uses Tailscale."
msgstr ""
"网页不能直接向端口 22 打开原始 TCP 套接字。CheerpX 通过 `Tailscale 集成 <https://cheerpx.io/docs/guides/Networking>`_ "
"提供连接能力。随后可用 netcat 中继，将 SSH 转发到访问者网络中可达的机器。netcat 本身不提供浏览器传输通道：下面的中继方案同时使用 Tailscale。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:23
msgid "Connect through Tailscale"
msgstr "通过 Tailscale 连接"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:25
msgid ""
"The terminal startup banner contains a clickable **Connect to Tailscale** link. It prints a "
"second link for the visitor's Tailscale login, which registers the browser guest in their "
"tailnet. The page shows connection status and the guest's assigned address. Signing in to the "
"host computer's Tailscale app does not automatically connect the guest; it needs its own login."
msgstr ""
"终端启动横幅包含可点击的 **连接 Tailscale** 链接。点击后会显示另一个用于登录 Tailscale 的链接，将浏览器虚拟机注册到访问者的 tailnet "
"中。页面会显示连接状态和分配给虚拟机的地址。在宿主计算机的 Tailscale 应用中登录，不会自动连接浏览器虚拟机；虚拟机需要单独登录。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:32
msgid "To prepare an SSH destination:"
msgstr "准备 SSH 目标机器："

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:34
msgid ""
"Install `Tailscale <https://tailscale.com/download>`_ on the destination machine and sign in to "
"the same tailnet."
msgstr "在目标机器上安装 `Tailscale <https://tailscale.com/download>`_，并登录同一个 tailnet。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:36
msgid ""
"Enable the machine's SSH server. On macOS, this is **Remote Login** in System Settings. On Linux,"
" enable the distribution's OpenSSH server."
msgstr "启用目标机器的 SSH 服务器。在 macOS 中，该设置为系统设置里的 **远程登录**；在 Linux 中，启用发行版提供的 OpenSSH 服务。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:38
msgid ""
"Allow the browser guest to reach the destination's SSH port in the tailnet access policy and the "
"destination's firewall."
msgstr "在 tailnet 访问策略和目标机器防火墙中，允许浏览器虚拟机访问目标的 SSH 端口。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:40
msgid ""
"Once the browser guest is connected, run this in its shell, substituting your account and the "
"destination's Tailscale IPv4 address::"
msgstr "浏览器虚拟机连接后，在其 shell 中运行以下命令，将账户和目标 Tailscale IPv4 地址替换为实际值：::"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:45
msgid ""
"Use the destination's Tailscale address, not ``localhost``: inside the demo, ``localhost`` refers"
" to the Linux guest. An exit node is unnecessary for connections to tailnet machines. See "
"`Tailscale's connection guide <https://tailscale.com/docs/how-to/connect-to-devices>`_."
msgstr ""
"使用目标的 Tailscale 地址，而非 ``localhost``：在演示中，``localhost`` 指向 Linux 虚拟机。连接 tailnet 内的机器不需要出口节点。参阅 "
"`Tailscale 连接指南 <https://tailscale.com/docs/how-to/connect-to-devices>`_。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:50
msgid ""
"This uses ordinary SSH over Tailscale networking. Tailscale SSH is a separate, optional service "
"with its own access rules; it is not required for this setup. Verify the destination's host-key "
"fingerprint before accepting a new key."
msgstr "此方案使用通过 Tailscale 网络传输的普通 SSH。Tailscale SSH 是另一个可选服务，拥有独立的访问规则；本设置不要求启用它。接受新密钥之前，请验证目标机器的主机密钥指纹。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:55
msgid "Run your own netcat relay"
msgstr "运行自己的 netcat 中继"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:57
msgid ""
"Use a relay when an SSH destination does not run Tailscale but another computer can reach it. The"
" relay computer must run Tailscale and be able to open a TCP connection to the destination's SSH "
"port."
msgstr "如果 SSH 目标没有运行 Tailscale，但另一台计算机可以访问它，就可以使用中继。中继计算机必须运行 Tailscale，并能向目标的 SSH 端口建立 TCP 连接。"

