"这些命令使用 **Nmap Ncat**，这是可执行文件名为 ``ncat`` 的 netcat 实现。其他名为 ``nc`` 的程序使用不同的监听和执行选项。在中继计算机上安装 "
"Ncat，例如：::"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:75
msgid "On the relay computer, replace ``192.168.1.50`` with the SSH server's LAN address, then run::"
msgstr "在中继计算机上，将 ``192.168.1.50`` 替换为 SSH 服务器的局域网地址，然后运行：::"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:81
msgid ""
"The listener binds only to the relay's Tailscale IPv4 address. Its tailnet policy and local "
"firewall must allow the browser guest to reach TCP port 2222. The destination must allow "
"connections from the relay. Keep the destination in the command fixed; each incoming connection "
"starts a separate forwarder to that destination. ``--keep-open`` permits reconnects and "
"independent simultaneous sessions."
msgstr ""
"监听器仅绑定中继的 Tailscale IPv4 地址。tailnet 策略和本地防火墙必须允许浏览器虚拟机访问 TCP 端口 "
"2222；目标服务器必须允许中继访问。在命令中固定目标地址；每个传入连接都会启动一个独立的转发进程，连接到该目标。``--keep-open`` 允许重连及独立的并发会话。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:88
msgid ""
"If the SSH server runs on the relay computer itself, use ``127.0.0.1`` in place of "
"``192.168.1.50``. If ``tailscale ip -4`` is unavailable, use the relay's Tailscale IPv4 address "
"explicitly as the listener address."
msgstr ""
"如果 SSH 服务器就在中继计算机上，请用 ``127.0.0.1`` 替换 ``192.168.1.50``。如果 ``tailscale ip -4`` 不可用，请明确使用中继的 "
"Tailscale IPv4 地址作为监听地址。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:92
msgid ""
"In the browser shell, substitute the relay's Tailscale IPv4 address and the destination's account"
" name::"
msgstr "在浏览器 shell 中，将中继的 Tailscale IPv4 地址和目标账户名替换为实际值：::"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:97
msgid ""
"``HostKeyAlias`` identifies the destination in SSH's known-hosts file; choose a distinct, stable "
"name for each destination. Verify the fingerprint against the destination SSH server, rather than"
" the relay. SSH authentication and encryption run between the guest and that destination; Ncat "
"forwards the encrypted stream without logging in on the visitor's behalf."
msgstr ""
"``HostKeyAlias`` 标识 SSH known-hosts 文件中的目标；为每个目标选择不同且稳定的名称。请核对目标 SSH 服务器的指纹，而不是中继的指纹。SSH "
"认证和加密在虚拟机与目标之间进行；Ncat 只转发加密数据流，不会代替访问者登录。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:103
msgid ""
"Leave the relay command running while using it. Press Ctrl+C to stop accepting connections, and "
"close any existing SSH sessions. No router port forwarding, public listener, or Tailscale exit "
"node is needed. This recipe uses Tailscale's normal infrastructure; Silkie supplies no relay "
"service."
msgstr ""
"使用期间请保持中继命令运行。按 Ctrl+C 停止接收连接，并关闭已有 SSH 会话。无需配置路由器端口转发、公共监听器或 Tailscale 出口节点。此方案使用 Tailscale "
"的正常基础设施，Silkie 不提供中继服务。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:108
msgid ""
"See the Ncat manuals for `command execution <https://nmap.org/ncat/guide/ncat-exec.html>`_ and "
"`port forwarding <https://nmap.org/ncat/guide/ncat-tricks.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"参阅 Ncat 手册中的 `命令执行 <https://nmap.org/ncat/guide/ncat-exec.html>`_ 和 `端口转发 "
"<https://nmap.org/ncat/guide/ncat-tricks.html>`_。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:113
msgid "Browser integration requirements"
msgstr "浏览器集成要求"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:115
msgid ""
"The CheerpX integration must use the visitor's interactive login. Configure "
"``networkInterface.loginUrlCb``, ``stateUpdateCb``, and ``netmapUpdateCb`` when creating the "
"guest, then call ``cx.networkLogin()`` from the explicit connect action. Present the login URL as"
" a link the visitor can open and show authentication failures and connection changes on the page."
" See `CheerpX networking <https://cheerpx.io/docs/guides/Networking>`_ and the `Linux.create "
"reference <https://cheerpx.io/docs/reference/CheerpX.Linux/create>`_."
msgstr ""
"CheerpX 集成必须使用访问者的交互式登录。创建虚拟机时配置 ``networkInterface.loginUrlCb``、``stateUpdateCb`` 和 "
"``netmapUpdateCb``，再由明确的连接操作调用 ``cx.networkLogin()``。将登录 URL 以可打开的链接显示，并在页面上展示认证失败及连接状态变化。参阅 "
"`CheerpX 网络功能 <https://cheerpx.io/docs/guides/Networking>`_ 和 `Linux.create 参考 "
"<https://cheerpx.io/docs/reference/CheerpX.Linux/create>`_。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:124
msgid ""
"Do not embed a project-owned Tailscale auth key or a default public proxy in the page or guest "
"image. The shell startup report must explain that external SSH requires the visitor's Tailscale "
"connection and link to this guide. Guest SSH keys and known-hosts data belong to the visitor's "
"guest filesystem, not a Silkie server."
msgstr ""
"不要在页面或虚拟机镜像中嵌入项目持有的 Tailscale 认证密钥，也不要预置公共代理。shell 启动报告必须说明：外部 SSH 需要访问者自己的 Tailscale "
"连接，并链接到本指南。虚拟机的 SSH 密钥和 known-hosts 数据保存在访问者的虚拟机文件系统中，而不在 Silkie 服务器上。"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:131
msgid "Validation status"
msgstr "验证状态"

#: docs/silkie/browser-ssh.rst:133
msgid ""
"The Ncat recipe has been checked on loopback with Ncat 7.991: 24 sessions, four concurrent "
"clients, and repeated binary exchanges totalling more than 12 MiB passed. A separate full-duplex "
"echo test sending a single 1 MiB burst stalled. This remains unresolved; the streaming check does"
" not establish reliability for every traffic pattern. Browser-to-server SSH, bulk transfers, and "
"reconnects through CheerpX and Tailscale still need end-to-end validation before the demo is "
"released."
msgstr ""
"已使用 Ncat 7.991 在回环网络上检查此方案：24 个会话、四个并发客户端，以及累计超过 12 MiB 的重复二进制数据交换均通过。另一个一次发送 1 MiB "
"突发数据的全双工回显测试发生了停滞，原因尚未解决；流式传输检查并不能证明每种流量模式都可靠。在演示发布前，仍需完成浏览器到服务器的 SSH、批量传输，以及通过 CheerpX 和 "
"Tailscale 重连的端到端验证。"

